      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-444-533"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-21" source="#source-465-503">Ⅰ</g></head>
        <p source="#source-535-543"><seg source="#source-535-543">梢が</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-543-569"><seg source="#source-543-569">空にとどいてゐる</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-569-589"><seg source="#source-569-589">美しい樹々よ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-589-621"><seg source="#source-589-621">花の咲かない…………</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-621-641"><seg source="#source-621-641">花はなくとも</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-641-681"><seg source="#source-641-681">ああ　せめてものわが願い</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-681-770"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-22" source="#source-702-740">Ⅱ</g></head>
        <p source="#source-772-789"><seg source="#source-772-789">樹々の編む</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-789-818"><seg source="#source-789-818">光りのハンモツクに</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-818-856"><seg source="#source-818-856">僕はつつましく腰をおろす</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-856-888"><seg source="#source-856-888">風が静かにひかるとき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-888-920"><seg source="#source-888-920">ゆれないハンモツクで</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-920-957"><seg source="#source-920-957">僕はそつと時間をみ失ふ</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-957-1046"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-23" source="#source-978-1016">Ⅲ</g></head>
        <p source="#source-1048-1074"><seg source="#source-1048-1074">小さな口をあけて</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1074-1106"><seg source="#source-1074-1106">ぽくぽくと駆けてくる</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1106-1117"><seg source="#source-1106-1117">波頭よ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1117-1131"><seg source="#source-1117-1131">さうして</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1131-1172"><seg source="#source-1131-1172">何も彼も洗ふがいい…………</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1172-1207"><seg source="#source-1172-1207">貝殻の中の小さな海にも</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1207-1221"><seg source="#source-1207-1221">冷い空が</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1221-1246"><seg source="#source-1221-1246">匂ふやうに光る</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head n="2" source="#source-1246-1335"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-24" source="#source-1267-1305">Ⅳ</g></head>
        <p source="#source-1337-1369"><seg source="#source-1337-1369">青い塔の半円形も消え</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1369-1407"><seg source="#source-1369-1407">匂ひの向ふへ花がこぼれた</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1407-1454"><seg source="#source-1407-1454">重たい風船のやうに暗い秋の陽が</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1454-1489"><seg source="#source-1454-1489">落ちてしまつて…………</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1489-1518"><seg source="#source-1489-1518">ひと掬ひの歌もない</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1518-1526"><seg source="#source-1518-1526">海よ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1526-1561"><seg source="#source-1526-1561">貨物船よりもぢつとして</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1561-1587"><seg source="#source-1561-1587">お前を視てゐる僕</seg></p>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-1587-1675" style="padding-inline-start: 8em">
          <p source="#source-1608-1675"><seg source="#source-1608-1614">（〈</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-1614-1645" corresp="#source-1616-1645"><seg source="#source-1614-1616">13</seg></hi><seg source="#source-1645-1675">年〉十一月讃岐にて）</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
